- Updated UI to clearly reflect the confirmation state.
Tradeoffs & Assumptions:
- Standard: `window.confirm`. Rejected because it blocks the UI thread and feels outdated.
- Lateral: A "Hold to Stop" button. Rejected because holding on mobile/web can trigger text selection or context menus.
- Minimalist (Chosen): Inline state toggle. Fits perfectly into the existing flow.

